# Race trait abilities for Athasian races (requires Expanded Psionics Handbook)
# Source: The (mostly) Complete Dragon Magazine Compendium (fan compilation of Dragon Magazine 3.0/3.5 content).
# SOURCEPAGE values refer to page numbers of the compendium PDF.
# Built for the Bahamut35e game mode (bahamutdragon/pcgen).


###Block: Athasian Aarakocra
Race Traits ~ Athasian Aarakocra	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianAarakocra Race Trait
Inborn Power	KEY:Athasian Aarakocra ~ Inborn Power	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianAarakocra Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.23	DESC:Gains 3 extra power points at 1st level and can manifest Elfsight as an inborn power (manifester level equals character level; save DC uses Charisma, or the key ability of a psionic class if higher). If you have a psionic class, add the points to your pool and the power to your powers known.
Flight	KEY:Athasian Aarakocra ~ Flight	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianAarakocra Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.23	DESC:Fly speed 90 ft. (average maneuverability).
Natural Attacks	KEY:Athasian Aarakocra ~ Natural Attacks	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianAarakocra Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.23	DESC:Flying: two talons (1d4 each) or a weapon held in the talons. On the ground: weapons in the wing-claws plus a secondary bite (1d3).
Weapon Proficiency	KEY:Athasian Aarakocra ~ Weapon Proficiency	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianAarakocra Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.23	DESC:Proficient with the javelin.
Racial Skills	KEY:Athasian Aarakocra ~ Racial Skills	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianAarakocra Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.23	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Craft (any one), Knowledge (nature), Listen, and Spot checks. Apply the Craft bonus manually.
Claustrophobic	KEY:Athasian Aarakocra ~ Claustrophobic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianAarakocra Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.23	DESC:-4 penalty on attack rolls and skill checks in enclosed areas.

###Block: Athasian Dwarf
Race Traits ~ Athasian Dwarf	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianDwarf Race Trait
Inborn Power	KEY:Athasian Dwarf ~ Inborn Power	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.24	DESC:Gains 3 extra power points at 1st level and can manifest Vigor as an inborn power (manifester level equals character level; save DC uses Charisma, or the key ability of a psionic class if higher). If you have a psionic class, add the points to your pool and the power to your powers known.
Steady Pace	KEY:Athasian Dwarf ~ Steady Pace	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.24	DESC:Speed 20 ft., never reduced by armor or encumbrance.
Stability	KEY:Athasian Dwarf ~ Stability	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.24	DESC:+4 bonus on ability checks to resist bull rush or trip while standing on the ground.
Magic Resistance	KEY:Athasian Dwarf ~ Magic Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.24	DESC:+2 racial bonus on saves against psionic powers, spells, and spell-like effects.
Focus	KEY:Athasian Dwarf ~ Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.24	DESC:+4 racial bonus on Will saves against charm or compulsion effects that would change, delay, or distract from the dwarf's chosen focus.
Dwarven Blood	KEY:Athasian Dwarf ~ Dwarven Blood	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.24	DESC:+4 racial bonus on Fortitude saves against poison.
Lost Traits	KEY:Athasian Dwarf ~ Lost Traits	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.24	DESC:Athasian dwarves lack stonecunning, weapon familiarity, and the standard dwarf's bonuses against orcs and giants and on Appraise and Craft.

###Block: Athasian Elan
Race Traits ~ Athasian Elan	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianElan Race Trait
Aberration	KEY:Athasian Elan ~ Aberration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElan Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.25	DESC:Elans are aberrations, but lack the darkvision normally granted by that type.
Resistance	KEY:Athasian Elan ~ Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElan Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.25	DESC:(Su) As an immediate action, spend 1 power point for a +4 racial bonus on saving throws until the start of your next action.
Resilience	KEY:Athasian Elan ~ Resilience	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElan Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.25	DESC:(Su) As an immediate action when taking damage, spend power points to reduce it by 2 per point spent.
Repletion	KEY:Athasian Elan ~ Repletion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElan Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.25	DESC:(Su) Spend 1 power point to sustain your body without food or water for 24 hours.
Naturally Psionic	KEY:Athasian Elan ~ Naturally Psionic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElan Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.25	DESC:Gains 2 bonus power points at 1st level.
Ageless	KEY:Athasian Elan ~ Ageless	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElan Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.25	DESC:Elans take no penalties from aging.

###Block: Athasian Elf
Race Traits ~ Athasian Elf	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianElf Race Trait
Inborn Power	KEY:Athasian Elf ~ Inborn Power	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.27	DESC:Gains 3 extra power points at 1st level and can manifest Conceal Thoughts as an inborn power (manifester level equals character level; save DC uses Charisma, or the key ability of a psionic class if higher). If you have a psionic class, add the points to your pool and the power to your powers known.
Swift	KEY:Athasian Elf ~ Swift	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.27	DESC:Base land speed 40 ft., increasing to 50 ft. at 10th level.
Elf-Running	KEY:Athasian Elf ~ Elf-Running	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.27	DESC:Endurance as a bonus feat.
Weapon Proficiency	KEY:Athasian Elf ~ Weapon Proficiency	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.27	DESC:Proficient with falchion, rapier, scimitar, longbow, and shortbow (including composite bows).
Keen Senses	KEY:Athasian Elf ~ Keen Senses	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.27	DESC:+%1 racial bonus on Listen, Search, and Spot checks (+2, rising to +4 at 5th level and +6 at 15th). Notices secret doors by passing within 5 feet.|2+if(TL>=5,2,0)+if(TL>=15,2,0)
Elven Discernment	KEY:Athasian Elf ~ Elven Discernment	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.27	DESC:+2 bonus on saves against illusion spells and effects. Athasian elves lose the standard elf's bonus against enchantments.

###Block: Athasian Half-Elf
Race Traits ~ Athasian Half-Elf	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianHalfElf Race Trait
Inborn Powers	KEY:Athasian Half-Elf ~ Inborn Powers	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHalfElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.28	DESC:3 extra power points at 1st level and the psionic charm power. At 5th level: +3 power points and detect hostile intent. At 10th: +5 power points and danger sense. At 15th: +7 power points and aura sight. Manifester level equals character level; DC uses Charisma or a psionic class's key ability.
Elven Blood	KEY:Athasian Half-Elf ~ Elven Blood	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHalfElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.28	DESC:Counts as an elf for race-related effects. +1 racial bonus on Listen, Search, and Spot; +2 on Diplomacy and Gather Information.
Elven Discernment	KEY:Athasian Half-Elf ~ Elven Discernment	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHalfElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.28	DESC:+2 racial bonus on saves against illusions. Athasian half-elves lose the standard half-elf's bonus against enchantments.

###Block: Athasian Half-Giant
Race Traits ~ Athasian Half-Giant	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianHalfGiant Race Trait
Fire Acclimated	KEY:Athasian Half-Giant ~ Fire Acclimated	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHalfGiant Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.29	DESC:+2 racial bonus on saves against fire and heat effects.
Powerful Build	KEY:Athasian Half-Giant ~ Powerful Build	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHalfGiant Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.29	DESC:Treated as one size larger for opposed size checks and size-based special attacks when advantageous; can use weapons one size larger without penalty.
Naturally Psionic	KEY:Athasian Half-Giant ~ Naturally Psionic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHalfGiant Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.29	DESC:Gains 2 bonus power points at 1st level. Psi-like ability: 1/day stomp (manifester level 1/2 Hit Dice, minimum 1st).
Athasian Variant	KEY:Athasian Half-Giant ~ Athasian Variant	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHalfGiant Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.29	DESC:Uses all standard half-giant traits, with Athasian languages, favored class barbarian, and level adjustment +1.

###Block: Athasian Halfling
Race Traits ~ Athasian Halfling	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianHalfling Race Trait
Inborn Power	KEY:Athasian Halfling ~ Inborn Power	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHalfling Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.30	DESC:Gains 3 extra power points at 1st level and can manifest Missive as an inborn power (manifester level equals character level; save DC uses Charisma, or the key ability of a psionic class if higher). If you have a psionic class, add the points to your pool and the power to your powers known.
Athletic	KEY:Athasian Halfling ~ Athletic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHalfling Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.30	DESC:+%1 racial bonus on Climb, Jump, and Move Silently (+2, +4 at 5th level, +8 at 15th). At 10th level, standing long jumps count as running jumps and accelerated climbing has no -5 penalty.|2+if(TL>=5,2,0)+if(TL>=15,4,0)
Halfling Traits	KEY:Athasian Halfling ~ Halfling Traits	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHalfling Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.30	DESC:+1 racial bonus on all saves, +2 morale bonus on saves against fear, +1 on attacks with thrown weapons and slings, +2 on Listen.

###Block: Athasian Human
Race Traits ~ Athasian Human	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianHuman Race Trait
Talented	KEY:Athasian Human ~ Talented	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHuman Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.31	DESC:+2 to one ability score and +2 to a different ability score (chosen when the race is applied).
Human Traits	KEY:Athasian Human ~ Human Traits	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHuman Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.31	DESC:Bonus feat at 1st level and 1 extra skill point per level (4 at 1st level).
Inborn Powers	KEY:Athasian Human ~ Inborn Powers	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianHuman Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.31	DESC:3 extra power points at 1st level and any one 1st-level psion/wilder power of your choice. At 5th level: +3 points and a 2nd-level psion power; 10th: +5 points and a 3rd-level power; 15th: +7 points and a 4th-level power. Add the chosen powers manually.

###Block: Athasian Maenad
Race Traits ~ Athasian Maenad	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianMaenad Race Trait
Naturally Psionic	KEY:Athasian Maenad ~ Naturally Psionic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianMaenad Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.32	DESC:Gains 2 bonus power points at 1st level. Psi-like ability: 1/day energy ray (sonic only; manifester level 1/2 Hit Dice, minimum 1st).
Outburst	KEY:Athasian Maenad ~ Outburst	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianMaenad Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.32	DESC:(Ex) Once per day, for up to 4 rounds, take -2 to Intelligence and Wisdom and gain +2 Strength.

###Block: Mul (DMC)
Race Traits ~ Mul (DMC)	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=MulDMC Race Trait
Inborn Power	KEY:Mul (DMC) ~ Inborn Power	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MulDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.33	DESC:Gains 3 extra power points at 1st level and can manifest Prescience (Offensive) as an inborn power (manifester level equals character level; save DC uses Charisma, or the key ability of a psionic class if higher). If you have a psionic class, add the points to your pool and the power to your powers known.
Hardy	KEY:Mul (DMC) ~ Hardy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MulDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.33	DESC:Needs only half as much rest to recover from fatigue and exhaustion.
Faster Natural Healing	KEY:Mul (DMC) ~ Faster Natural Healing	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MulDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.33	DESC:Heals 2 hit points per level per day of rest. Gains fast healing 1 at 10th level and fast healing 3 at 15th.

###Block: Athasian Pterran
Race Traits ~ Athasian Pterran	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianPterran Race Trait
Inborn Power	KEY:Athasian Pterran ~ Inborn Power	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianPterran Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.34	DESC:Gains 3 extra power points at 1st level and can manifest Burst as an inborn power (manifester level equals character level; save DC uses Charisma, or the key ability of a psionic class if higher). If you have a psionic class, add the points to your pool and the power to your powers known.
Thick Scales	KEY:Athasian Pterran ~ Thick Scales	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianPterran Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.34	DESC:+5 natural armor bonus.
Natural Attacks	KEY:Athasian Pterran ~ Natural Attacks	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianPterran Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.34	DESC:Two talons (1d4 each) or a weapon held in the talons, plus a secondary bite (1d3).
Tail	KEY:Athasian Pterran ~ Tail	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianPterran Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.34	DESC:+4 racial bonus on Balance and Jump checks.

###Block: Athasian Thri-Kreen
Race Traits ~ Athasian Thri-Kreen	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=AthasianThriKreen Race Trait
Racial Hit Dice	KEY:Athasian Thri-Kreen ~ Racial Hit Dice	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianThriKreen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.35	DESC:Two monstrous humanoid Hit Dice (2d8): +2 base attack, Fort +0, Ref +3, Will +3, skill points 5 x (2 + Int mod), one feat.
Sleepless	KEY:Athasian Thri-Kreen ~ Sleepless	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianThriKreen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.35	DESC:Immune to magic sleep effects; spellcasters still need 8 hours of rest to prepare spells.
Multiple Limbs	KEY:Athasian Thri-Kreen ~ Multiple Limbs	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianThriKreen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.35	DESC:Four arms. May take Multiweapon Fighting instead of Two-Weapon Fighting, and may take Multiattack (not bonus feats).
Natural Attacks	KEY:Athasian Thri-Kreen ~ Natural Attacks	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianThriKreen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.35	DESC:Four claws (1d4) and a secondary bite (1d4). Armed thri-kreen may also make one claw or bite attack as a secondary attack.
Poison	KEY:Athasian Thri-Kreen ~ Poison	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianThriKreen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.35	DESC:(Ex) Bite, Fortitude DC 11 + Con modifier, initial 1d6 Dex, secondary paralysis. Enough venom for one bite per day.
Leap	KEY:Athasian Thri-Kreen ~ Leap	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianThriKreen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.35	DESC:(Ex) +30 racial bonus on Jump checks.
Weapon Familiarity	KEY:Athasian Thri-Kreen ~ Weapon Familiarity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianThriKreen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.35	DESC:The gythka and chatkcha are martial weapons for thri-kreen.
Psi-Like Abilities	KEY:Athasian Thri-Kreen ~ Psi-Like Abilities	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianThriKreen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.35	DESC:3/day chameleon, know direction and location; 1/day greater concealing amorpha, metaphysical claw. Manifester level 1/2 Hit Dice (minimum 1st). 1 bonus power point.
Desert Camouflage	KEY:Athasian Thri-Kreen ~ Desert Camouflage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:AthasianThriKreen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.35	DESC:+4 racial bonus on Hide checks in sandy or arid settings.
